#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Execute Code Runtimes"
msgstr "execute_code 运行时"

#. type: Title #
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "execute_code Multi-Runtime"
msgstr "execute_code 多运行时"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "> One tool, multiple runtimes; default Bun; extend with Python / Deno as needed.\n"
msgstr "> 一个工具、多种运行时；默认 Bun；按需扩展 Python / Deno。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:12
msgid ""
"`execute_code` runs short scripts in a controlled subprocess. The LLM must "
"know which language to write and which runtime to pick — otherwise Python "
"sent to Node fails."
msgstr ""
"`execute_code` 在受控子进程中运行短脚本。LLM 必须知道写什么语言、选哪个运行时"
"——否则把 Python 发给 Node 会失败。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Division from terminal"
msgstr "与 terminal 的分工"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:21
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "|           | `execute_code`                               | `terminal`                              |\n"
#| "| --------- | -------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n"
#| "| Execution | No shell, fixed runtime                      | shell=true                              |\n"
#| "| Best for  | Short scripts, data processing, logic checks | System commands, pipes, git, long tasks |\n"
#| "| Output    | 50KB cap, configurable timeout               | Same limits but more freedom            |\n"
#| "| Security  | Smaller surface (no shell injection)         | Larger surface                          |\n"
msgid ""
"|           | `execute_code`                               | `terminal`                                                               |\n"
"| --------- | -------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| Execution | No shell, fixed runtime                      | Default `shell=false` (argv); `shell=true` needs `FREEANIMA_ALLOW_SHELL` |\n"
"| Best for  | Short scripts, data processing, logic checks | System commands, git, long tasks; pipes only with ALLOW_SHELL            |\n"
"| Output    | 50KB cap, configurable timeout               | Same limits                                                              |\n"
"| Security  | No shell injection; **not** a FS sandbox     | Catastrophic command hard deny + workdir path policy; still ≠ OS sandbox |\n"
msgstr ""
"|           | `execute_code`                               | `terminal`                              |\n"
"| --------- | -------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 执行 | 无 shell，固定 runtime                      | shell=true                              |\n"
"| 适用  | 短脚本、数据处理、逻辑检查 | 系统命令、管道、git、长任务 |\n"
"| 输出    | 50KB 上限，可配置超时               | 同等限制但更自由            |\n"
"| 安全  | 攻击面更小（无 shell 注入）         | 攻击面更大                          |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:23
msgid ""
"Use `execute_code(runtime=\"python\")` for Python batches, not `python3 -c "
"\"...\"` in terminal."
msgstr ""
"Python 批处理请用 `execute_code(runtime=\"python\")`，不要在 terminal 里 "
"`python3 -c \"...\"`。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "API"
msgstr "API"

#. type: Fenced code block (typescript)
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"execute_code({\n"
"  code: string,\n"
"  runtime?: \"bun\" | \"nodejs\" | \"python\" | \"deno\",  // default bun\n"
"  timeout?: number,       // seconds, default 300, max 600\n"
"})\n"
msgstr ""
"execute_code({\n"
"  code: string,\n"
"  runtime?: \"bun\" | \"nodejs\" | \"python\" | \"deno\",  // default bun\n"
"  timeout?: number,       // seconds, default 300, max 600\n"
"})\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Available Runtimes"
msgstr "可用运行时"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:42
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| runtime    | Language                | Status                  |\n"
"| ---------- | ----------------------- | ----------------------- |\n"
"| **bun**    | TypeScript / JavaScript | ✅ default              |\n"
"| **nodejs** | TypeScript / JavaScript | ✅ implemented          |\n"
"| **python** | Python                  | 🔲 reserved (Issue #40) |\n"
"| **deno**   | TypeScript              | 🔲 reserved (Issue #40) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| runtime    | 语言                    | 状态                    |\n"
"| ---------- | ----------------------- | ----------------------- |\n"
"| **bun**    | TypeScript / JavaScript | ✅ 默认                 |\n"
"| **nodejs** | TypeScript / JavaScript | ✅ 已实现               |\n"
"| **python** | Python                  | 🔲 预留（Issue #40）    |\n"
"| **deno**   | TypeScript              | 🔲 预留（Issue #40）    |\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration (Reserved)"
msgstr "配置（预留）"

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:45
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"execute_code:\n"
"  default_runtime: bun\n"
"  runtimes:\n"
"    nodejs:\n"
"      enabled: true\n"
"    python:\n"
"      enabled: true\n"
"      command: python3\n"
"    deno:\n"
"      enabled: false\n"
msgstr ""
"execute_code:\n"
"  default_runtime: bun\n"
"  runtimes:\n"
"    nodejs:\n"
"      enabled: true\n"
"    python:\n"
"      enabled: true\n"
"      command: python3\n"
"    deno:\n"
"      enabled: false\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:59
msgid "Disabled runtimes return a clear error listing available runtimes."
msgstr "禁用的运行时会返回明确错误，并列出可用运行时。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:66
msgid "Always `shell: false` (see [`security.md`](../guide/security.md))"
msgstr "始终 `shell: false`（见 [`security.md`](../guide/security.md)）"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:66
msgid "Timeout and output size limits match current implementation"
msgstr "超时与输出大小限制与当前实现一致"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:66
msgid "**Do not** auto-guess runtime from code content"
msgstr "**不要**根据代码内容自动猜测运行时"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:66
msgid ""
"JS runtimes can still import `node:fs`—terminal command hard denies do "
"**not** apply inside `code_execute`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "Credential Injection (Planned)"
msgstr "凭证注入（规划中）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:70
msgid ""
"Architecture allows credential path injection in `execute_code` environments "
"— **not yet implemented**. See [Issue #40](https://github.com/freeanima-org/"
"freeanima/issues/40)."
msgstr ""
"架构允许在 `execute_code` 环境中注入凭证路径 — **尚未实现**。见 [Issue #40]"
"(https://github.com/freeanima-org/freeanima/issues/40)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:71
msgid ""
"Credential values are never exposed to the LLM; injected from Vault at "
"runtime — no vault CLI inside runtimes."
msgstr "凭证值永不暴露给 LLM；运行时从 Vault 注入 — 运行时内不提供 vault CLI。"
